BVRB3R Stripe local QA listener
- Forwarding standard Stripe events to http://localhost:3000/api/stripe/webhook
- Forwarding Connect events to http://localhost:3000/api/stripe/webhook
- Keep the app running on http://localhost:3000 in the other terminal
- Stripe will print a webhook signing secret below
- If the printed whsec_... value changed, update STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET in .env.local and restart the app
